# Ignore everything by default
*
*/

# Explicitly track these files. (Health files - CONTRIBUTING,
# CODE_OF_CONDUCT, SECURITY - live under .github/; STYLE.md lives under docs/.)
!.gitignore
!.editorconfig
!LICENSE
!README.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CITATION.cff
!run_nestapp.m

# Documentation (hand-written only; the generated API site is built into
# ./site by tools/gen_docs.m and deployed in CI - it is NOT committed)
!docs/
!docs/*.md

# Developer tooling
!tools/
!tools/*.m

# Source files
#
# RECURSIVE, not one entry per folder. Line 3 (`*/`) ignores every directory,
# so a whitelist naming folders individually means a NEW subfolder is silently
# untracked - `git add` reports nothing and the commit looks clean. That has
# now happened four times in this repo (tests/pure, tests/golden, and every
# folder of the src/ reorganisation). `!src/**/` un-ignores directories at any
# depth, so src/ no longer needs maintaining here.
!src/
!src/**/
!src/**/*.m
!src/**/*.png
!src/**/*.jpg
!src/**/*.mat

# Tests
#
# NOTE: line 3 ignores every directory, so a folder under tests/ that is not
# named here is SILENTLY untracked - `git add` reports nothing and the commit
# looks clean. That has now happened twice: when tests/pure/ was created (two
# test files written, run green, left out of the commit without a word), and
# again at the cutover, when tests/golden/ was not added here and only the
# already-indexed goldens stayed tracked - a NEW golden would have vanished.
#
# tests/pure/SuiteHygieneTest.m asks `git check-ignore` whether a new file in
# each tracked tests/ folder would be added, so a third occurrence fails a
# test instead of being discovered later. Adding a folder here is still manual.
!tests/
# Suites: folders named for what a test NEEDS (EEGLAB, a display).
!tests/pure/
!tests/pure/*.m
!tests/eeglab/
!tests/eeglab/*.m
!tests/gui/
!tests/gui/*.m
!tests/eeglab_gui/
!tests/eeglab_gui/*.m
!tests/helpers/
!tests/helpers/*.m
# Recorded step behaviour. JSON so a changed golden is readable in a diff.
!tests/golden/
!tests/golden/*.json
!tests/*.m

# CI & community health (CONTRIBUTING / CODE_OF_CONDUCT / SECURITY +
# pull_request_template live here as .github/*.md)
!.github/
!.github/*.md
!.github/CODEOWNERS
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*.yml
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*.md
